ter"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Czym jest serum z kwasem azelainowym?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-tleg3cfeax" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Serum z kwasem azelainowym to kosmetyk redukujący przebarwienia, zawierający kwas azelainowy oraz ekstrakty roślinne, które pomagają zmniejszyć widoczność porów, regulują wydzielanie sebum i redukują niedoskonałości.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-7ytlrfyen0w" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-7ytlrfyen0w"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Jakie składniki aktywne zawiera serum z kwasem azelainowym?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="1"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-5co7bmybmet" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Serum zawiera kwas azelainowy, ekstrakty roślinne z korzenia rabarbaru, liści morwy i magnolii lekarskiej, sok z aloesu oraz alantoinę.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-x7yqe8kwhj" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-x7yqe8kwhj"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Jak działa serum z kwasem azelainowym?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="2"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-mrdsfxux8qa" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Stosowanie serum z kwasem azelainowym przywraca jednolity koloryt skóry, rozjaśnia przebarwienia, zmniejsza widoczność porów, redukuje powstawanie niedoskonałości oraz reguluje wydzielanie sebum. Dodatkowo, serum koi, regeneruje i nawilża skórę.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-u9887ejbef8" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-u9887ejbef8"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Jak prawidłowo stosować serum z kwasem azelainowym?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="3"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-pp4znlczssm" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Na oczyszczoną i suchą skórę twarzy nałóż niewielką ilość produktu. Poczekaj do wchłonięcia, następnie nałóż ulubiony krem.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-za70sejx57c" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-za70sejx57c"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Czy serum z kwasem azelainowym jest odpowiednie dla wszystkich typów skóry?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="4"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-q4x5c2ypcf" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Tak, serum z kwasem azelainowym jest odpowiednie dla każdego typu skóry, w tym skóry wrażliwej i skłonnej do niedoskonałości.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-1kb7rj7pr78" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-1kb7rj7pr78"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Czy serum z kwasem azelainowym można stosować pod makijaż?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="5"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-ntcwwoqtde" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Tak, serum z kwasem azelainowym można stosować pod makijaż, ale najlepiej używać go wieczorem, aby skóra mogła się regenerować podczas snu.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-jcbsxvfeh68" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-jcbsxvfeh68"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Czy serum z kwasem azelainowym można stosować w ciąży?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="6"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-tsrs4kl48m" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Stosowanie serum z kwasem azelainowym w ciąży jest zazwyczaj bezpieczne, jednak przed rozpoczęciem jakiejkolwiek nowej kuracji kosmetycznej w czasie ciąży, warto skonsultować się z lekarzem.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></